    <name>
      <text>11.3 Two-sided linear inequality (integers)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p></p><p>For this question, you answers should be given inside the curly brackets, for example like this &nbsp;\( \{ 8, 9, 10\} \)</p><p><br></p><p>(a) \( {@pp@} \leq n &lt; {@qq@} \) where \( n \) is an integer.</p><p>Write down all of the possible values of&nbsp;\( n \) as a set.</p><p>[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p><p>[[feedback:prt1]]<br></p><p align="right"><b>(1)</b></p><p>(b)&nbsp;\( {@aa@} \leq {@bb*n+cc@} &lt; {@dd@} \)&nbsp;where \( n \) is an integer.</p><p>Write down all of the possible values of&nbsp;\( n \) as a set.<br></p><p>[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]]</p><p>[[feedback:prt2]]<br></p><p align="right"><b>(2)</b></p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
